# Keeps the build context small and secrets out of image layers.
**/bin/
**/obj/
# Sass output. Generated into the image by the build, and gitignored on the host, so a locally
# compiled copy riding in on its own mtime could let the incremental Sass step skip and publish
# a stale theme. This line and the matching .gitignore entry have to agree on what is generated.
**/wwwroot/css/
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/TestResults/
.git/
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
tests/
README.md
compose.yaml
compose.dev.yaml
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.dev
.dockerignore
